There is one thing
I forgot to ask.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.960 line:91%
Can I push the whistle
button, please?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.800 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(blare)</i></c>

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.600 line:85%
Thank you! <i>(laughs)</i>

